590
00:24:52,520 --> 00:24:54,120
I'll grab an apron.

591
00:25:01,020 --> 00:25:02,340
(Gets apron)

592
00:25:10,220 --> 00:25:12,020
(Helps put it on)

593
00:25:14,320 --> 00:25:14,840
Okay.

594
00:25:27,040 --> 00:25:28,800
Have you guys ever had chicken frames?

595
00:25:28,800 --> 00:25:30,120
I have, but I don't know

596
00:25:30,120 --> 00:25:32,280
