597
00:25:32,280 --> 00:25:33,740
I've never had it like this.

598
00:25:33,740 --> 00:25:34,540
You've never had it like this?

599
00:25:34,540 --> 00:25:36,080
I've never had it tossed like this.

600
00:25:36,080 --> 00:25:36,880
I feel like the flavor's

601
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:38,280
