602
00:25:38,280 --> 00:25:39,560
Have you had it in Shenyang?

603
00:25:39,560 --> 00:25:40,280
I have.

604
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:42,320
The Shenyang version

605
00:25:42,320 --> 00:25:43,680
