606
00:25:45,640 --> 00:25:46,960
The chicken's different.

607
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:51,240
Local
and out-of-town chicken taste different.

608
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:55,680
The stargazing room was nice yesterday.

609
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:56,440
Yesterday?

610
00:25:57,080 --> 00:25:58,000
I saw it.

611
00:25:58,000 --> 00:25:59,520
