629
00:26:39,200 --> 00:26:39,960
Don't accuse me. I didn't.

630
00:26:39,960 --> 00:26:40,480
Then show us.

631
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:41,280
Show us.

632
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:43,240
I didn't hear you clearly,

633
00:26:43,240 --> 00:26:44,680
so I wanted
to watch your face while he talked.

634
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:45,720
It was surprise?

635
00:26:45,720 --> 00:26:45,980
Right.

636
00:26:45,980 --> 00:26:46,980
You weren't laughing at me, right?

637
00:26:47,280 --> 00:26:47,960
No.

638
00:26:49,640 --> 00:26:51,480
I wanted her to see it.

639
00:26:51,480 --> 00:26:52,640
Actually, I had an idea, you know?

640
00:26:52,640 --> 00:26:53,760
I wanted to print out

641
00:26:53,760 --> 00:26:54,480
a picture of Venus,

642
00:26:54,480 --> 00:26:55,040
put it

643
00:26:55,040 --> 00:26:56,240
over the telescope lens,

644
00:26:56,240 --> 00:26:57,400
and when you looked through it,

645
00:26:57,400 --> 00:26:57,880
you'd...

646
00:26:57,880 --> 00:26:58,160
Yeah.

647
00:26:58,160 --> 00:26:59,160
You'd see the picture.

648
00:26:59,160 --> 00:27:00,520
Print out?

649
00:27:03,600 --> 00:27:04,500
Are you full?

650
00:27:04,500 --> 00:27:05,600
(Hands over a tissue)
Wipe your mouth.

651
00:27:11,080 --> 00:27:11,480
Your arm

652
00:27:11,480 --> 00:27:13,220
