looks better now, right?

653
00:27:15,040 --> 00:27:16,520
It's gone. I guess it was a bite.

654
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:17,200
I don't know.

655
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:18,040
Let me see.

656
00:27:18,040 --> 00:27:18,520
Your neck.

657
00:27:19,020 --> 00:27:19,520
(Leans closer)

658
00:27:19,520 --> 00:27:20,360
It's gone here.

659
00:27:20,360 --> 00:27:21,280
Does it still hurt?

660
00:27:21,280 --> 00:27:22,080
Here?

661
00:27:23,540 --> 00:27:25,060
(Gets closer)

662
00:27:25,820 --> 00:27:27,420
(Looks)

663
00:27:27,680 --> 00:27:29,360
This looks like a bite too.

664
00:27:30,280 --> 00:27:31,000
Give it a little pinch.

665
00:27:36,560 --> 00:27:37,800
But these red spots were

666
00:27:37,800 --> 00:27:38,880
