667
00:27:44,120 --> 00:27:45,200
Let's watch them for another two days.

668
00:27:45,680 --> 00:27:46,480
They should clear up.

669
00:27:46,920 --> 00:27:48,240
If they don't, we'll go to the hospital.

670
00:27:50,980 --> 00:27:52,100
So what's on the second floor

671
00:27:52,100 --> 00:27:53,320
and first floor of the stargazing room?

672
00:27:53,320 --> 00:27:54,720
There's a little couch downstairs.

673
00:27:54,720 --> 00:27:56,240
And what's upstairs?

674
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:57,120
That's where you stargaze.

675
00:27:57,120 --> 00:27:57,520
Stargaze?

676
00:27:57,520 --> 00:27:58,600
So where did you

677
00:27:58,600 --> 00:27:58,960
eat?

678
00:27:59,120 --> 00:27:59,520
Upstairs too.

679
00:27:59,520 --> 00:28:00,400
Upstairs?

680
00:28:01,680 --> 00:28:03,000
Yesterday, Zhao Xilun and I were

681
00:28:03,000 --> 00:28:04,040
rowing downstairs.

682
00:28:04,040 --> 00:28:05,000
I didn't

683
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,080
notice Si

684
00:28:06,080 --> 00:28:07,800
and the other person were upstairs.

685
00:28:07,800 --> 00:28:09,000
So we were rowing

686
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:10,480
and singing really loud downstairs.

687
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:11,480
Well, mostly he was singing.

688
00:28:13,320 --> 00:28:14,520
I told him Si and the other person

689
00:28:14,520 --> 00:28:16,040
were having a date upstairs.

690
00:28:16,040 --> 00:28:17,760
I said, stop being such a show-off.

691
00:28:19,920 --> 00:28:20,880
But then I ended up

692
00:28:20,880 --> 00:28:21,960
joining him.

693
00:28:21,960 --> 00:28:22,480
We started

694
00:28:22,480 --> 00:28:23,640
singing together.

695
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:26,360
Could you guys

696
00:28:26,360 --> 00:28:27,880
