697
00:28:28,160 --> 00:28:28,920
Yeah.

698
00:28:28,920 --> 00:28:30,280
You could?

699
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:32,400
Wait, I have a question.

700
00:28:32,400 --> 00:28:34,200
Who rowed faster, them or us?

701
00:28:34,200 --> 00:28:35,640
Say they were faster.

702
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:36,960
(Playing along)
You guys were faster.

703
00:28:37,160 --> 00:28:39,600
You guys were faster.

704
00:28:39,600 --> 00:28:41,040
I'm not buying it.

705
00:28:41,040 --> 00:28:42,960
We can race.

706
00:28:42,960 --> 00:28:44,560
We definitely need a race.

707
00:28:44,560 --> 00:28:45,480
Our team

708
00:28:45,480 --> 00:28:46,840
(Full of confidence)
is taking first place for sure.

709
00:28:46,840 --> 00:28:48,880
Let's see whether brains or brawn wins.

710
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:50,760
You said you'd
give us a three-minute head start.

711
00:28:51,040 --> 00:28:52,080
A three-minute head start?

712
00:28:52,080 --> 00:28:53,640
We'll be back by then.

713
00:28:54,800 --> 00:28:57,000
I could give you
30 minutes and it'd still be fine.

714
00:28:57,800 --> 00:28:58,420
You said it.

715
00:28:58,420 --> 00:28:58,800
I take it back.

716
00:28:58,800 --> 00:28:59,900
(Takes it back)
I take it back.

717
00:29:01,080 --> 00:29:04,280
Bye.

718
00:29:05,520 --> 00:29:06,680
I noticed something.

719
00:29:06,680 --> 00:29:08,640
When you're facing forward,

720
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:10,200
